# listdemo: the ListBox widget driving Tea v2 under a real pty (S6).
#
# The demo renders a live "i=<idx> st=<st> v=<fv>" header above the 40x19
# list (12 items, perPage 4, 3 pages), so every cursor/filter state has a
# UNIQUE needle.  Coverage: j moves the cursor down, crossing the page
# boundary at index 3 -> 4 (the R6 page-flip); "/" enters filtering (filter
# line + dimmed items); typing "es" shrinks 12 -> 6 items (case-sensitive
# substring over title OR description); esc cancels the filter; "/" + "es" +
# enter applies it (FilterApplied, "“es” 6 items • 6 filtered").  q quits via
# the TaskQuit scan (show cursor + exit 0).
#
# Escapes: \e[?25l hide cursor, \e[?25h show cursor, \x1b esc, \r enter.
expect \e[?25l\e[2Ki=0 st=unf v=
send j
expect i=1 st=unf v=
send jjj
expect i=4 st=unf v=
send /
expect i=0 st=flt v=
send es
expect st=flt v=es
send \x1b
expect st=unf v=
send /
expect i=0 st=flt v=
send es
expect st=flt v=es
send \r
expect st=app v=es
send q
expect \e[?25h
expect_exit 0
